{
  "v": 1,
  "description": "Sense Remote sunucu listesi ortak test vektoru (panel packages/shared ve istemci src/sense/testdata). Zarf bicimi strategy zarfiyla ayni ({k,p,s}, Ed25519, ayni panel anahtari) ama imza alani ayri: imzalanan veri = prefix (ASCII) || base64url_decode(p). Cihaz seq sayacina dokunmaz. Dogrulama sirasi: zarf bicimi -> k listede -> p/s cozumu (s 64 bayt) -> imza (servers oneki) -> JSON + sema (bilinmeyen alan yok; typ servers; 1..max_servers sunucu; id ^[a-z0-9-]{1,32}$ ve priority 1..99 tekrarsiz; ad 1..64, basta/sonda bosluk ve denetim karakteri yok; rendezvous/relay host[:port] ASCII, rustdesk/localhost/0.0.0.0/127.* degil, port 1..65535; key 44 karakter base64, rustdesk_key degil; butun key'ler ayni; 0 < exp - iat <= max_lifetime_s) -> iss -> did ve duuid -> iat - clock_skew_s <= now_s <= exp + clock_skew_s -> rev >= last_rev ve (rev > last_rev ya da iat > last_iat). Her vakada tek kusur vardir. Gizli anahtar hicbir yerde yok.",
  "prefix": "sense-remote/servers/v1\n",
  "clock_skew_s": 300,
  "max_lifetime_s": 2592000,
  "max_servers": 8,
  "rustdesk_key": "OeVuKk5nlHiXp+APNn0Y3pC1Iwpwn44JGqrQCsWqmBw=",
